acceptance_criteria:
1) Terraform module 'vpc-probe-runner' that provisions ephemeral probe runners (IAM, subnet attachment, SSM/remote exec) and can be invoked by the canary pipeline;
2) Probe harness binary or container image that can replay tenant profiles and emit structured JSON telemetry to our telemetry endpoint;
3) Integration with Canary controller to run probes pre-promotion and produce a deterministic pass/fail verdict plus confidence score;
4) Dashboards and alerts for probe outcomes and probe-side telemetry (p95 latency, error_rate, kv_cache_hit_ratio, batch_size_distribution);
5) Playbook for on-call when probes fail with clear remediation steps and rollback criteria;
6) Pilot run completed for 3 tenants in staging with documented results and follow-up items.
